// Chapter 104: fixtures for coax/lib/nostr/nipkeys.coax's checks. The
// treasury: holder alice (a SOV agent, key 1), keyco (key 2) and an
// attested enclave (key 3), each with a signet tpub at m/48h/1h/0h/2h from
// the seed SHA-256("chapter 104 <name>"). Every value below was made by an
// independent Python reference (coax/tests/nostr/keys_reference.py: pure
// integers, hashlib), not by Coax:
// tpubs, enrollment and wallet digests, the descriptor checksums, the
// PSBT, and each enrollment's BIP-322 possession proof (signed and verified
// by coax/tests/bitcoin/bip322_reference.py). Test data only. Loaded by
// nipkeys.coax.

